   "title": "About this workflow",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "Blends two pictures with Flux Redux: both are read and their looks combined into one new picture.\nPicture A is the step's input; Picture B is the second slot. Strength A / Strength B: lower one to let the other dominate.\nA short prompt can steer the mix (optional).\n\nModel: Flux.1 schnell all-in-one checkpoints (flux1-schnell-fp8, DreamPhoto). 4 steps, CFG 1, no negative prompt.\nDefaults: 4 steps, CFG 1.0, euler / simple."
   ],
